2. KQL Query 1: Activity Log Telemetry Ingestion Check
Used in Log Analytics (law-secops-prod-01) to confirm that diag-secops-activity-logs is actively streaming control plane events from sub-ent-platform-prod:

Code snippet
AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| summarize EventCount = count() by CategoryValue, ResourceGroup, ActivityStatusValue
| order by EventCount desc




3. KQL Query 2: Scheduled Analytic Rule Detection Logic
The KQL query embedded inside the Sentinel Scheduled Analytic Rule to detect administrative and role assignment modifications:

Code snippet
AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where ActivityStatusValue in~ ("Success", "Succeeded")
| where OperationNameValue has "Microsoft.Resources/subscriptions/write" 
   or OperationNameValue has "Microsoft.Authorization/roleAssignments/write"
| project TimeGenerated, 
          SubscriptionId, 
          ResourceGroup, 
          Caller, 
          OperationNameValue, 
          ActivityStatusValue




4. KQL Query 3: Verify Sentinel Incident Creation & Automation Execution
Used to verify that the Analytic Rule triggered an incident and that Sentinel logged the execution:

Code snippet
SecurityIncident
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| project TimeGenerated, IncidentNumber, Title, Severity, Status, Owner, RelatedAnalyticRuleIds
| order by TimeGenerated desc